  "title": "Social Security Marital Allowances — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PayrollManagement.SocialSecurityMaritalAllowance",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>An amount added to the pay for social security by marital status, for employees whose education falls in a given branch.</p><p>Only rows for a branch of one of the employee's educations count. A male employee gets the row matching his marital status. A female employee who is not single gets every non-single row for her branches added together — legacy behaviour, kept on purpose.</p>",
